Hmm. Let me simplify the contract:

Two coordinate modes:
- Screen mode (HUD): coordinates are screen pixels, bottom-left origin.
- World mode: `gfxSetWorldOrigin(camX, camY)` — draw coords are world coords; gfx subtracts origin and multiplies by scale.

